00:16:35,121 --> 00:16:38,320
This room can hold about 100,000 pounds.

344
00:16:38,321 --> 00:16:39,820
So can this room.

345
00:16:39,821 --> 00:16:41,820
OK, so we're actually going to get a chance

346
00:16:41,821 --> 00:16:43,820
to try a sample from these massive tanks.

