444
00:21:35,861 --> 00:21:41,340
So like this, we're able to spread them in a layer of our cakes.

445
00:21:41,341 --> 00:21:45,100
Carvel introduced their flying saucer ice cream sandwiches

446
00:21:45,101 --> 00:21:47,640
