00:37:19,701 --> 00:37:25,380
The cookie dough, it's soft, different soft than the ice cream.

741
00:37:26,380 --> 00:37:33,460
It's, I'm telling you, if you can go to a creamery, if you can go to Turkey Hill, it's better than every soft serve.

