00:37:44,880 --> 00:37:45,580
What's that?

749
00:37:45,581 --> 00:37:46,700
In a case.

750
00:37:46,701 --> 00:37:51,700
That six pack will then go into the freezer.

751
00:37:51,701 --> 00:37:54,700
If you being nice, patient, informed,

752
00:37:54,701 --> 00:37:57,700
and letting me do fun stuff weren't enough,

753
00:37:57,701 --> 00:38:00,700
you gave me a bite of arguably some of the best ice cream

754
00:38:00,701 --> 00:38:03,700
I've ever had in the coolest way imaginable.

755
00:38:03,701 --> 00:38:06,700
So I'm giving you an air hug and an elbow bump.

756
00:38:06,701 --> 00:38:08,700
You're so cool, Michelle. Thank you so much.

