00:38:16,700 --> 00:38:18,700
That's it.

760
00:38:18,701 --> 00:38:20,700
Our batch of Turkey Hill cookie dough ice cream

761
00:38:20,701 --> 00:38:24,700
is on its way to a supermarket near you.

762
00:38:26,700 --> 00:38:28,700
In many ways, the story of ice cream in America

763
00:38:28,701 --> 00:38:30,700
is like the story of America itself.

764
00:38:30,701 --> 00:38:32,700
It's been with us from our earliest days

765
00:38:32,701 --> 00:38:36,700
and has grown and changed just as our country has.

766
00:38:36,701 --> 00:38:38,700
Whether in a cake or a cone or straight off the factory line,

767
00:38:38,701 --> 00:38:40,700
it was amazing to see how it's been.

768
00:38:40,701 --> 00:38:42,700
It's been amazing to see how it's been

769
00:38:42,701 --> 00:38:46,700
straight off the factory line, it was amazing to see how it's made.

770
00:38:46,701 --> 00:38:48,700
Wow.

